UID:EaSogKgLtcS4LzFIxT90D
SUMMARY:HCP Fall Open House (Online)
DTSTAMP:20260818T032835Z
DTSTART:20260825T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us online on Tuesday\, August 25\, between 6-8 pm at our F
	all 2026 Open House to learn about new and upcoming courses\, hands-on wor
