UID:WJ95NgpIkOHes0U8ZNZP7
SUMMARY:2nd Annual Texas BVI Fall Field Fest
DTSTAMP:20260818T032835Z
DTSTART:20261009T093000Z
DESCRIPTION:Date & Time:Friday\, October 9\, 2026Time: 9:30 Am to 1 PM \nLo
	cation:Houston Sports Park12131 Kirby Dr\, Houston\, TX 77045 \nEvent Desc
	ription:Join us October 9\, 2026\, at Houston Sports Park for an accessibl
	e sports field day for youth and adults who are blind or low vision as we 
	bring together an estimated 500 participants for a full day of sports\, ga
	mes\, and community at the Texas BVI Fall Field Fest\, featuring two dynam
	ic fields of FUN: \nField 1: Introduction to Sports – Try your hand at Bli
	nd Soccer\, Beep Baseball\, Blind Tennis\, and Blind Fencing\, with more s
	ports to come!\nField 2: Field Day Games – Classic competitions like Tug o
	f War\, Long Jump\, Ball Toss\, Running with Tethers\, and other adaptive 
	favorites. \nWith cooling and rest stations under the tents\, this event i
	s designed for connection\, challenge\, and celebration. \nPresented by Th
	e Lighthouse of Houston\, in partnership with the Houston Dynamo and Dash.
	 \nBe part of it! Registration opens August 17.\n\nhttps://houstonlighthou
	se.org/event/2nd-annual-texas-bvi-fall-field-fest/\n\nFrom Houston Lightho
	use
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/2nd-annual-texas-bvi-fall-field-fes
	t/
LOCATION:Houston Sports Park\, 12131 Kirby Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77045\, Unit
	ed States
